**10 [[Takuya (Enemy)|Takuyas]] spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns.

==Strategy==
For this stage you will need some type of cat that is Strong Against or Resistant to Angels, Darks and most importantly Floating. Start by accumulating enemies with meatshields, until the Takuyas start spawning, then use a nuker (such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]]). Start pushing with other ranged attackers until you hit the base. After you need to spam meatshields (bring at least 5, 2 crazed and 3 normal) and spawn your attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] one after another, you can also use [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] in tandem with Bahamut as another DPS. You should have preferably the [[Ototo Corps#Slow Beam|Slow Beam]] in your base and have cleared at least EoC chapters 1-3. Also have your cats to at least level 20.

